Space Cab for CHGame

Space Cab is by Vampirics (graphics) and filmote (code), for the Pokitto:
https://github.com/Press-Play-On-Tape/SpaceCab_Pokitto
It is free software under the GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSE),
and so is this port. src/game/ holds the game's sources, modified for
CHGame in October 2026 (each change is commented); the levels (src/game/Levels.cpp) are the
SPCAB000-012.raw files of its release SpaceCab_V1.0.2.zip.

src/game/Font3x5.cpp is the Pokitto library's font3x5 (Aurélien Rodot's
Gamebuino font, LGPL 3). src/game/Pokitto.* re-implements the parts of the
Pokitto library the game uses.

The Pokitto's recorded voices and theme tune are not included: CHGame's
piezo plays short tones in their place.
